web: a slack histogram bar drills down with the histogram's filters

Clicking a bar asked for the paths in its slack range across every path
group and clock, so a reg2reg histogram listed in2reg, reg2out and
unclocked port paths too. The request now carries the selected path
groups and clock; getReport passes the groups to findPathEnds and keeps
the path ends on that clock.

Carried by bazel-orfs; not upstreamed. Retires on a
//:bump onto an OpenROAD that carries it.
